    "deviceBinaryBytesApprox": 23245688,
    "bytesNote": "What build/p316/SPEC.md §3.5 measured. Informational and not a gate, because Go, the SDK and the linker decide those bytes. The build prints what it produced, and TailscaleKit.stamp.json beside the product records it."
